WEBVTT

00:08.400 --> 00:11.910
So, what brings you two here today?

00:11.910 --> 00:14.740
Actually, I came here
to ask you a favor.

00:15.120 --> 00:16.080
A favor?

00:16.080 --> 00:16.960
Yeah.

00:16.960 --> 00:21.880
I was wondering if I could stay
at your house for a while.

00:21.880 --> 00:22.290
Huh?!

00:23.090 --> 00:24.500
You're joking, right?

00:24.500 --> 00:27.470
This is not a joke.

00:27.470 --> 00:29.470
And it wouldn't be funny at all.

00:29.870 --> 00:31.800
What happened?

00:33.300 --> 00:36.520
This is something that you
should know as well.

00:36.980 --> 00:39.310
The reason why we came here.

00:52.700 --> 01:04.460
CHILLIN' IN ANOTHER WORLD
WITH LV2 SUPER CHEAT POWERS

02:09.980 --> 02:13.990
#10 NEW HOUSEMATES

02:18.270 --> 02:19.360
Lord Gholl!

02:20.040 --> 02:21.700
Sorry to disturb you.

02:21.700 --> 02:24.620
I've got an urgent message
from Lady Uliminas.

02:25.020 --> 02:25.880
What is it?

02:25.880 --> 02:28.710
Lord Yuigarde is staging a coup.

02:28.710 --> 02:32.110
He and his entourage have seized
the throne room.

02:35.220 --> 02:37.930
Y-You can't be serious!

02:38.340 --> 02:41.020
You're the Infernal Four,
the pillars of the Dark Army!

02:41.020 --> 02:43.270
Serious or not,

02:43.270 --> 02:47.730
they just asked us to be the witnesses for
the duel between Yuigarde and Lord Gholl.

02:48.150 --> 02:50.530
That's the problem!

02:50.530 --> 02:54.700
You should be sending those traitors
to the prison right now!

02:54.700 --> 02:56.860
I don't wanna.

02:56.860 --> 03:02.750
We agreed on this duel because this
might be the impulse Lord Gholl needs.

03:02.750 --> 03:04.750
Yorminyt is right.

03:04.750 --> 03:07.460
Lord Gholl hasn't been himself lately.

03:07.460 --> 03:10.750
He was hardly at the citadel
and didn't continue our attacks.

03:10.750 --> 03:13.010
The underlings are starting to doubt him.

03:14.800 --> 03:19.640
Hugi, Mugi! You guys were looked
after by Lord Gholl, weren't you?

03:19.640 --> 03:21.600
This and that...

03:21.600 --> 03:23.310
...are different matters.

03:24.100 --> 03:26.940
What is your stance on this, Sleip?

03:26.940 --> 03:31.150
For me, the only one worthy
of the throne is Lord Gholl.

03:31.550 --> 03:35.150
But now that rebellion
is starting to happen,

03:35.150 --> 03:38.110
he needs to show his
strength once more.

03:46.620 --> 03:49.630
Welcome to the throne room!

03:49.630 --> 03:52.170
A bit hasty, aren't we?

03:52.170 --> 03:54.380
That throne is still Lord Gholl's.

03:54.380 --> 03:59.090
It will soon be Lord Yuigarde's, so why not?

03:59.090 --> 04:02.930
Anyway, there's no interference
allowed in the duel.

04:02.930 --> 04:05.140
You will cooperate with us, right?

04:05.140 --> 04:07.270
There's no need to tell us that again.

04:07.270 --> 04:08.600
No need to tell us twice.

04:09.040 --> 04:10.310
I appreciate it.

04:10.310 --> 04:12.320
That's enough, Phufun!

04:12.810 --> 04:18.910
Do you know that Lord Gholl
is always thinking of our well-being?

04:18.910 --> 04:21.120
Oh, you're here too?

04:21.510 --> 04:24.370
I guess it's because
your presence is so little.

04:25.200 --> 04:30.710
You traitors are under arrest!

04:36.080 --> 04:37.880
It won't work.

04:38.320 --> 04:39.760
The weak shouldn't be here!

04:53.360 --> 04:56.070
Damn it...

04:56.070 --> 05:00.610
As expected of Uliminas.
She's really good at using tricks.

05:01.090 --> 05:04.700
We can't have you interrupting the duel.

05:07.110 --> 05:09.750
Greanyl, I leave her to you.

05:09.750 --> 05:10.560
Yes, Sir.

05:12.080 --> 05:13.960
There he is.

05:13.960 --> 05:16.170
I'm tired of waiting, Brother.

05:16.170 --> 05:18.760
I mean, Gholl the Dark One.

05:19.340 --> 05:23.680
I challenge you to a duel
for your title and throne!

05:24.390 --> 05:26.140
Help! Let go of us!

05:26.140 --> 05:27.560
That's the Dark One?!

05:27.560 --> 05:30.600
This must be joking!
I never wanted to meet him!

05:31.020 --> 05:34.060
I don't have time to entertain
this pointless duel.

05:34.060 --> 05:37.780
Your own underlings
are also assenting to this duel.

05:38.280 --> 05:42.320
They know that you're not
worthy to lead us.

05:42.320 --> 05:46.870
Everyone is getting tired of your foolishness,
which is unbecoming of a Dark One.

05:47.490 --> 05:49.250
Let me ask you something.

05:50.250 --> 05:53.120
What is this foolishness of mine
that you speak of?

05:53.120 --> 05:53.960
Huh?

05:53.960 --> 05:56.670
You're still playing dumb with me?

05:57.070 --> 06:01.510
I heard you often go to the human towns
and indulge in their amusement.

06:01.970 --> 06:03.590
But that's not all!

06:03.990 --> 06:07.850
You called for a retreat
when we were so close to victory.

06:07.850 --> 06:10.220
You rejected to resume the advance.

06:10.220 --> 06:14.440
It's clear that you aren't serious
about subjugating humans.

06:14.800 --> 06:18.400
It seems that you have no actual
intentions to conquer.

06:18.400 --> 06:25.360
The doubt about you siding with humans
has spread through the entire army.

06:26.120 --> 06:27.700
I see.

06:27.700 --> 06:30.750
So the army that marched into Klyrode
without my knowing

06:30.750 --> 06:33.330
was your doing, Yuigarde?

06:33.330 --> 06:34.500
That's right.

06:34.500 --> 06:37.170
Because I didn't intend to let
a chance go away just like that.

06:37.660 --> 06:39.380
Do you all agree with him?

06:42.340 --> 06:46.010
I see. Then, I have no choice.

06:49.060 --> 06:52.850
Now, swear to the Demon Ring,
the symbol of the Dark One,

06:52.850 --> 06:55.060
to pledge the throne for this duel!

06:55.060 --> 07:00.990
This rage and pressure...
This is the true power of Lord Gholl.

07:08.200 --> 07:10.330
I, Dark One Gholl, hereby declare...

07:10.790 --> 07:13.450
...that I relinquish the ownership
of the Demon Ring.

07:14.250 --> 07:15.160
What?!

07:15.160 --> 07:16.120
Take it.

07:19.630 --> 07:21.880
I resign as the Dark One.

07:21.880 --> 07:25.010
You dare to mock me?!

07:25.010 --> 07:28.840
If you all think my actions
are unworthy of a Dark One,

07:28.840 --> 07:31.470
then there's no need for me
in this position anymore.

07:32.680 --> 07:36.730
Are you kidding me?!
Don't run away, Gholl!

07:36.730 --> 07:38.100
Oh, right.

07:48.820 --> 07:50.660
Lord Yuigarde!

07:51.050 --> 07:53.700
That was for Uliminas.

07:53.700 --> 07:56.200
All of you, thanks for everything.

07:57.710 --> 07:58.960
Lord Gholl!

07:58.960 --> 08:01.040
Please wait a minute!

08:01.040 --> 08:03.300
I didn't think it would
turn out like this...

08:04.260 --> 08:08.720
Are we saved, Sir Hero?

08:08.720 --> 08:12.680
Yeah, this is our chance to escape!

08:14.850 --> 08:16.390
That's the gist of it.

08:16.750 --> 08:18.850
Yuigarde became the Dark One?

08:18.850 --> 08:22.360
We didn't have money
or a place to return to.

08:22.810 --> 08:26.070
I understand your reason, but I have to ask
for everyone's opinion first.

08:26.070 --> 08:27.650
I have returned.

08:28.020 --> 08:31.370
It was a good hunt today—

08:31.370 --> 08:33.530
Oh, Balirossa!

08:33.530 --> 08:34.790
Welcome back!

08:36.620 --> 08:38.770
What a great timing.

08:39.390 --> 08:45.210
They're hoping to stay here for a while.

08:45.210 --> 08:46.210
What do you think?

08:48.030 --> 08:50.630
I look forward to it, Balirossa.

08:53.100 --> 08:56.100
You don't let her guard down easily, huh?

08:56.100 --> 08:58.140
As expected of Balirossa.

08:58.140 --> 09:02.190
Huh? No matter how you see her,
she's totally scared.

09:02.770 --> 09:05.070
You can relax.

09:05.450 --> 09:07.320
I'm not the Dark One anymore.

09:07.320 --> 09:10.530
I gave up the throne
and left the Dark Army.

09:11.660 --> 09:17.910
Even though I resigned,
I can't live in demon territory.

09:17.910 --> 09:23.330
And the only acquaintance I have
is just Flio in human territory.

09:24.000 --> 09:27.050
I'm asking you for a favor as a friend.

09:27.880 --> 09:32.840
But wasn't the Dark Army
just attacked a few days ago?

09:32.840 --> 09:37.100
It seemed that the current Dark One,
Yuigarde, was the one who ordered them.

09:37.450 --> 09:40.310
She's right.
Right now I am not your enemy.

09:40.850 --> 09:44.700
I promise not to put you in danger.

09:45.250 --> 09:48.440
Like when you used to come by for tea?

09:48.850 --> 09:49.860
You're right.

09:49.860 --> 09:52.150
But don't forget that we're still demons!

09:53.200 --> 09:55.870
Please don't scare them, Uliminas!

09:57.950 --> 10:00.830
Either way, even if you're with Uliminas,

10:01.210 --> 10:05.080
there's no way that
a former Dark One is broke.

10:05.080 --> 10:10.510
After this incident, the intel unit I lead
also left the Dark Army.

10:10.510 --> 10:14.970
And this former Dark One
gave them all the money he had.

10:14.970 --> 10:21.810
Their hard work kept
casualties to a minimum.

10:21.810 --> 10:23.770
They deserved a reward, right?

10:23.770 --> 10:27.310
It's because you're like this,
a coup happened!

10:27.310 --> 10:28.860
You're too soft!

10:28.860 --> 10:30.570
So casual.

10:30.570 --> 10:33.200
It's always me who gets
the short end of the stick.

10:33.200 --> 10:35.780
There's no need for me to use
honorifics anymore.

10:35.780 --> 10:37.660
Forgive me, Uliminas.

10:38.780 --> 10:41.830
I, too, took the throne from my father

10:41.830 --> 10:44.750
because I did not like the ways
of my predecessor.

10:44.750 --> 10:48.380
It was inevitable that I would have to
step down if I did not gain support.

10:49.670 --> 10:52.340
Well, that may be true, but...

10:52.340 --> 10:57.050
No problem, there must be something
we can do without a throne.

10:57.550 --> 11:03.680
Just like when Flio stopped the Dark Army
as the nameless adventurer.

11:05.850 --> 11:07.520
You knew about that?

11:07.520 --> 11:08.860
Of course.

11:10.730 --> 11:13.320
So, back on topic...

11:13.780 --> 11:16.620
Rys and I don't have any problem
with them staying here.

11:17.150 --> 11:18.530
What about you, girls?

11:18.530 --> 11:22.490
Well, if you and Lady Rys
are okay with it,

11:22.490 --> 11:26.210
we're not in a position
to refuse your decision.

11:26.210 --> 11:26.830
Huh?!

11:26.830 --> 11:30.130
They promised not to do anything scary.

11:30.130 --> 11:32.710
I think it's okay.

11:33.040 --> 11:36.930
I can think of them
as your tea-drinking friends.

11:36.930 --> 11:38.680
No objections.

11:38.680 --> 11:43.560
But if they prove a danger, this Hiya
is ready to become your shield or spear.

11:43.560 --> 11:46.270
W-What are you saying?!

11:46.270 --> 11:50.060
Perhaps he's retired,
but he was the Dark One!

11:50.060 --> 11:51.770
And that girl was her confederate!

11:51.770 --> 11:54.230
How could we live under
the same roof with them?!

11:55.950 --> 11:57.910
Then, Balirossa...

11:58.220 --> 12:05.120
You want me to leave my former boss
and co-workers without a place to sleep?

12:06.870 --> 12:11.630
You're just pressuring her
if you put it that way, Rys.

12:13.250 --> 12:14.510
What should I do?

12:16.010 --> 12:18.550
Sybe? Even you?

12:27.690 --> 12:28.890
Fi...

12:28.890 --> 12:30.850
Fine!

12:30.850 --> 12:34.110
We get the strongest demon in our pack!

12:50.000 --> 12:52.710
What a splendid field!

12:53.130 --> 12:55.300
Do you have anything for me
to help you?

12:55.650 --> 12:59.680
No! I'm fine with just
the djinn helping me.

13:03.470 --> 13:05.470
I could help with the horses.

13:05.890 --> 13:08.680
Since I'm used to taking care
of the magic beasts.

13:12.100 --> 13:16.570
Ghozal, please don't disturb me!

13:20.150 --> 13:22.700
This is amazing!

13:23.620 --> 13:26.080
You made all of these?

13:26.080 --> 13:26.990
Yeah.

13:26.990 --> 13:31.620
We make and sell weapons, armor,
and miscellaneous goods.

13:33.540 --> 13:38.840
Balirossa and the others also help me
with testing for adventurer's use,

13:39.300 --> 13:41.380
so that I can improve them.

13:42.800 --> 13:44.800
The dragon scales on this shield...

13:44.800 --> 13:46.140
Oh, about that...

13:49.430 --> 13:53.100
The spoils belong to the victor.

13:53.100 --> 13:55.610
Besides, we were the ones
who attacked you.

13:57.820 --> 14:02.200
When I look at it, it's enchanted
with many layers of magic.

14:02.200 --> 14:03.910
Thanks to the dragon scale.

14:04.570 --> 14:08.040
Each scale has the property
to store magic power.

14:08.040 --> 14:09.040
I see.

14:09.430 --> 14:12.710
If the human army
all had shields like this,

14:12.710 --> 14:15.380
even the Dark Army
would have a hard time.

14:15.960 --> 14:18.250
These are for adventurers only.

14:18.250 --> 14:23.180
You already knew that the magic enchanted
in it wouldn't work in large-scale combat.

14:25.260 --> 14:27.010
As expected of you!

14:27.550 --> 14:30.890
How can he be so friendly with a human?

14:30.890 --> 14:35.180
Isn't it fine?
He's not the Dark One anymore.

14:35.690 --> 14:37.270
But...

14:37.630 --> 14:41.780
He seems more lively than
when he leads the demons.

14:42.190 --> 14:44.740
It's complicated,
to be honest.

15:37.040 --> 15:39.750
You can't sleep?

15:40.750 --> 15:42.300
Here, herb tea.

15:42.880 --> 15:45.550
If you need snacks,
we have cookies too.

15:46.090 --> 15:49.010
Thank you, Lady Rys.

15:49.360 --> 15:54.170
Actually, Rys is worried since
you don't seem to be in good spirits.

15:54.170 --> 15:55.730
I want to know what's bothering you.

15:57.730 --> 16:03.610
Sorry if we seemed to force you
to accept Ghozal and Uliminas.

16:03.610 --> 16:06.200
That's why, can we talk it out a bit?

16:06.200 --> 16:11.410
It's fine. In the first place,
it's not my place to say anything to it.

16:11.910 --> 16:15.490
I was just surprised
by how quickly they accepted them.

16:16.000 --> 16:17.120
I see.

16:17.870 --> 16:20.380
I like our current lifestyle.

16:21.290 --> 16:25.550
We make a living by hunting for materials
and crafting them into armor for sale.

16:25.550 --> 16:28.800
We eat vegetables from the fields
managed by Blossom.

16:28.800 --> 16:32.720
We help Byleri and Sybe to take care
of the magic beasts.

16:32.720 --> 16:35.890
We study magic with Belano and Hiya.

16:36.930 --> 16:39.730
We live together in harmony.

16:40.270 --> 16:44.270
It's an ideal, but it doesn't
come true very often.

16:44.270 --> 16:46.530
I see.

16:47.530 --> 16:50.860
As expected,
I don't belong in this house.

16:50.860 --> 16:52.620
Balirossa...

16:52.620 --> 16:57.450
I wanted to continue to stay by you both.

16:57.450 --> 17:02.130
Unlike everyone,
I have nothing to offer.

17:02.130 --> 17:03.500
Besides...

17:04.210 --> 17:06.510
I know, demons though they may be,

17:06.890 --> 17:12.930
we can talk while laughing, respecting
our differences, and sharing meals.

17:12.930 --> 17:15.140
In that sense, they're exactly like us.

17:15.760 --> 17:20.600
I know that to the demons,
we are also the aggressors.

17:21.350 --> 17:25.070
Even so, I still can't accept it!

17:25.390 --> 17:28.240
I never made it to actual combat,

17:28.240 --> 17:35.080
but I still saw injured knights
who were crying for their lost friends.

17:36.790 --> 17:43.000
Even though he's not a bad person
or he's no longer the Dark One,

17:43.000 --> 17:47.130
I just can't live happily
under the same roof with him.

17:49.590 --> 17:51.970
It's normal if you think that way.

17:52.930 --> 17:56.640
It's not just you who have
hard feelings toward the demons.

17:56.640 --> 18:01.020
I think each human
in this world has it.

18:01.020 --> 18:03.480
Because such is life.

18:03.480 --> 18:09.280
But I don't think Ghozal came here
because he is in trouble.

18:11.070 --> 18:12.570
Is that so?

18:12.570 --> 18:15.910
Well, he probably wants to keep
a close eye on this house.

18:15.910 --> 18:19.120
Between my dear husband,
Hiya, Damalynas inside Hiya,

18:19.620 --> 18:21.710
and of course, me too.

18:22.250 --> 18:27.670
This house has gathered forces
that pose a threat to both sides.

18:27.670 --> 18:31.800
Doesn't it bother you to be watched?

18:31.800 --> 18:32.920
Not really.

18:32.920 --> 18:35.260
What do we have to hide?

18:35.260 --> 18:38.890
That's why, there's no need
to pent up your feelings.

18:39.270 --> 18:43.730
Living together in harmony means
you accept them for who they are

18:43.730 --> 18:46.810
but not forcing yourself
to get along with them.

18:48.690 --> 18:51.570
Accepting them for who they are?

18:51.570 --> 18:56.410
By the way, I wonder why you're okay
with me but not the Dark One?

18:57.660 --> 19:00.870
I was once in the Dark Army, too.

19:00.870 --> 19:05.670
And the first time we met,
I planned to let my troops eat you alive.

19:05.670 --> 19:07.540
Huh? Really?!

19:07.540 --> 19:08.710
Really.

19:11.170 --> 19:12.840
It's impossible!

19:12.840 --> 19:19.050
I always see you acting so silly!
I can't perceive you as a threat anymore!

19:19.050 --> 19:21.430
Are you trying to pick a fight?

19:22.270 --> 19:24.770
You said you have nothing to offer,

19:25.410 --> 19:28.360
but Balirossa, you are already helpful.

19:30.020 --> 19:34.280
You were the one
who taught me to make these.

19:38.240 --> 19:39.900
Try it.

19:40.990 --> 19:42.260
It's surprisingly delicious.

19:42.740 --> 19:46.040
What do you mean by surprisingly?

19:46.040 --> 19:47.170
Sorry.

19:55.760 --> 19:56.970
I hereby declare this!

19:58.590 --> 20:00.800
Ghozal. Uliminas.

20:01.240 --> 20:05.680
Should either of you harm a human,

20:05.680 --> 20:07.520
I, Balirossa, won't forgive you!

20:07.890 --> 20:10.650
You accept us for living together
in the same house,

20:10.650 --> 20:13.530
but also keep an eye on us
at all times, huh?

20:13.940 --> 20:20.950
Oh, what can a knight
who was so scared yesterday do?

20:20.950 --> 20:22.950
S-Shut up!

20:22.950 --> 20:27.910
Even you lost against Sir Flio twice!

20:27.910 --> 20:32.210
Meow! You dare to say that, huh?!

20:42.680 --> 20:46.350
I look forward to it, Balirossa.

20:48.140 --> 20:53.320
I'll shake your hand when I decide
that I can trust you both.

21:00.110 --> 21:01.570
Let's go, Sybe!

21:02.240 --> 21:04.450
It's a good day for hunting.

21:22.090 --> 21:24.180
Take that, you demons!

21:24.180 --> 21:28.560
I can't run anymore, Sir Hero!

21:28.560 --> 21:32.400
Just a bit more until we leave
the demon territory!

21:32.400 --> 21:38.530
Once we get to town, we'll sell the jewels
and magic gems we took from their treasury!

21:38.530 --> 21:42.030
After that, we can sleep at an inn
and take a relaxing bath!

21:42.030 --> 21:44.870
Bath? That sounds good!

21:44.870 --> 21:49.500
But you didn't forget that
we're on the wanted list, right?

21:49.500 --> 21:51.160
I didn't!

21:51.160 --> 21:53.960
We're going to make it somehow
after we leave Klyrode!

21:53.960 --> 21:57.800
It's rare to see you being clever
for once, Sir Hero.

21:57.800 --> 21:59.340
What do you mean by that?!

21:59.340 --> 22:00.550
Well, you know...

22:00.550 --> 22:01.680
Don't tease me!

22:01.680 --> 22:04.220
Enough with the talks,
let's keep running!

22:04.220 --> 22:07.810
Run until we reach
the other side of the horizon!

23:40.520 --> 23:42.690
Please take care of me from now on.

23:42.690 --> 23:43.280
Okay...

23:43.280 --> 23:44.440
Don't be so anxious.

23:44.440 --> 23:46.780
I'm a clean freak and won't be noisy.

23:46.780 --> 23:49.660
I'm good with socializing
and getting along with the neighbors.

23:49.660 --> 23:50.450
Well...

23:50.450 --> 23:54.410
Don't say that with a smug face!
That's why you are...!

23:54.410 --> 23:56.750
Next episode:
"Steamy Hot Spring Trip Part One."

23:56.750 --> 23:58.290
NEXT EPISODE: STEAMY HOT SPRING TRIP PART ONE
Did I say something weird?

23:58.290 --> 24:00.040
NEXT EPISODE: STEAMY HOT SPRING TRIP PART ONE
I've had enough!
